C("deliver","Delivery","I can't deliver results.",
 "You haven't got a long list of finished clients yet, so your brain has no 'proof file' to pull from. And 'results' sounds huge — like you must make a clinic famous.",
 ["Half true: you can't promise a #1 spot in Google Maps — nobody honestly can. Google says ranking depends on relevance, distance and prominence, and distance is outside anyone's control.",
  "But the thing you actually sell is concrete and checkable: a complete, correct Google Business Profile — right categories, hours, photos, services, description, review replies. Google's own help page lists exactly these as things a business can improve.",
  "You can finish that list in 7 working days. That IS the deliverable. 'Results' = the checklist done + you show the before/after of the profile.",
  "Your refund guarantee means the risk sits with you, not the client — so even in the worst case nobody is harmed."],
 "I deliver a specific, finished job: a complete profile, done right, in 7 working days. I don't promise rankings; I promise the work.",
 ["Write down what you deliver as a checklist (10–15 items).","Ask: can I do each item? (Yes — they're all in Google's help pages.)","Separate 'what I control' (the work) from 'what Google decides' (ranking).","Promise only the first. Show the second honestly as 'what we'll measure'.","Say it out loud: 'Jag lovar jobbet, inte placeringen.'"],
 dict(type="circle",inner=["Complete profile","Right categories","Photos & hours","Review replies","Done in 7 days"],outer=["Exact ranking","Competitors","Google's algorithm"]),
 "Write your 12-point delivery checklist for the Map Pack fix and save it in your notes.",
 dict(title="When a client asks 'Kan du garantera plats 1?'",lines=["Ärligt svar: nej, och den som lovar det chansar.","Det jag lovar är att er profil är komplett och rätt inställd inom 7 arbetsdagar – kategorier, tjänster, bilder, öppettider och svar på omdömen.","Det är de saker Google själva säger att ett företag kan påverka.","Och är du inte nöjd får du pengarna tillbaka."]),
 src=("gbp","gbp_guide"))
